{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cascadou is a delightful chain\u2011reaction deck builder</strong> where poker hands topple into each other like dominoes. Each round raises the target score, so plan your sequence, trigger <strong>explosive cascades</strong>, and use smart upgrades to keep your run alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and explode poker hands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/622ca3634fac6758b1ab0cbee22b2f17.poster.avif?t=1766392717\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/622ca3634fac6758b1ab0cbee22b2f17.webm?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/622ca3634fac6758b1ab0cbee22b2f17.mp4?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Playing Cascadou is easy!</i> Clicking a card automatically plays the connected poker hands, but with limited moves per round you need to <strong>plan</strong>, <strong>create</strong> and <strong>execute</strong> the biggest scoring hands to survive for seven days.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/3ce23e71bce8c9921159e76faecc07ea.poster.avif?t=1766392717\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/3ce23e71bce8c9921159e76faecc07ea.webm?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/3ce23e71bce8c9921159e76faecc07ea.mp4?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your standard 52\u2011card deck can be upgraded with collectible <strong>stickers</strong>: from simple score boosts, to hand\u2011specific synergies, to wild mechanic\u2011benders that transform cards or even the rules themselves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set up and set off powerful chain reactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/b6b3ffa6ae9f40c042198d981fff6f07.poster.avif?t=1766392717\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/b6b3ffa6ae9f40c042198d981fff6f07.webm?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/b6b3ffa6ae9f40c042198d981fff6f07.mp4?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle optional <strong>challenges</strong> to earn <strong>badges</strong> that permanently <strong>power up</strong> your hands, and discover <strong>special cards</strong> with abilities of their own. Unlock new modes and secrets as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/aea3f85b99cf84a8fb0b902d1dcef1f7.poster.avif?t=1766392717\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/aea3f85b99cf84a8fb0b902d1dcef1f7.webm?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/aea3f85b99cf84a8fb0b902d1dcef1f7.mp4?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ stickers to collect, combine, and experiment with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple play modes for beginners and advanced players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily Challenges: Chill Mode (free swaps, chase the longest chains) and Solitaire (remove all 52 cards in 20 moves or less)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morning, Afternoon, and Night stages with optional challenges and big rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 rounds plus a tough final level that tests your deck and your skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets to uncover and new modes and stickers to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted art and music by solo developer machineboy from Norway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability with endless deck, sticker, and badge combos </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So, take off your shoes, kick back and soak in the delightful chain reactions of <strong>Cascadou</strong>!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842900?t=1766392717","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/61251f335c10c4bc2b8123852e4c4f618fcf63e2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766392717","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/fbe345ac413edf8e2c33fdb88b91d5b5b0d3415d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766392717","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/fbe345ac413edf8e2c33fdb88b91d5b5b0d3415d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766392717","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4143930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cascadou is a delightful chain\u2011reaction deck builder</strong> where poker hands topple into each other like dominoes. Each round raises the target score, so plan your sequence, trigger <strong>explosive cascades</strong>, and use smart upgrades to keep your run alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and explode poker hands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/622ca3634fac6758b1ab0cbee22b2f17.poster.avif?t=1766392717\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/622ca3634fac6758b1ab0cbee22b2f17.webm?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/622ca3634fac6758b1ab0cbee22b2f17.mp4?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Playing Cascadou is easy!</i> Clicking a card automatically plays the connected poker hands, but with limited moves per round you need to <strong>plan</strong>, <strong>create</strong> and <strong>execute</strong> the biggest scoring hands to survive for seven days.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/3ce23e71bce8c9921159e76faecc07ea.poster.avif?t=1766392717\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/3ce23e71bce8c9921159e76faecc07ea.webm?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/3ce23e71bce8c9921159e76faecc07ea.mp4?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your standard 52\u2011card deck can be upgraded with collectible <strong>stickers</strong>: from simple score boosts, to hand\u2011specific synergies, to wild mechanic\u2011benders that transform cards or even the rules themselves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set up and set off powerful chain reactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/b6b3ffa6ae9f40c042198d981fff6f07.poster.avif?t=1766392717\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/b6b3ffa6ae9f40c042198d981fff6f07.webm?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/b6b3ffa6ae9f40c042198d981fff6f07.mp4?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle optional <strong>challenges</strong> to earn <strong>badges</strong> that permanently <strong>power up</strong> your hands, and discover <strong>special cards</strong> with abilities of their own. Unlock new modes and secrets as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/aea3f85b99cf84a8fb0b902d1dcef1f7.poster.avif?t=1766392717\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/aea3f85b99cf84a8fb0b902d1dcef1f7.webm?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/extras/aea3f85b99cf84a8fb0b902d1dcef1f7.mp4?t=1766392717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ stickers to collect, combine, and experiment with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple play modes for beginners and advanced players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily Challenges: Chill Mode (free swaps, chase the longest chains) and Solitaire (remove all 52 cards in 20 moves or less)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morning, Afternoon, and Night stages with optional challenges and big rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 rounds plus a tough final level that tests your deck and your skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets to uncover and new modes and stickers to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted art and music by solo developer machineboy from Norway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability with endless deck, sticker, and badge combos </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So, take off your shoes, kick back and soak in the delightful chain reactions of <strong>Cascadou</strong>!</i></p>","developers":["Mattis Folkestad"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842900/e84c6fd878f2b562fda3ed2dc936b8f46a197110/header.jpg?t=1766392717","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3842900/2088580759/029ba0cafa1d050675d4798abd5ec0a97055d01a/1762896409/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762898355","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3842900/2088580759/029ba0caf